SUMMARY:Winslow: An Evening of The Eagles
DESCRIPTION:Saturday September 12th\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $32.65 + Fees\nReserved Mezzanine Seating | $32.65 + Fees\nReserved Balcony Seating | $37.75 + Fees\nReserved Riser Seating | $43.25 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n————————————————–\nPresented by Mickey’s Black Box\n————————————————–\nWinslow Tribute Band celebrates the iconic American band The Eagles\, delivering their timeless music with precision and passion. This powerhouse ensemble recreates the live performance of The Eagles and the signature sound that made them one of the most successful artists in the 70s. \nOur band members are seasoned musicians who have a deep love for the Eagles’ music\, striving to recreate the magic of their live performances. From ‘Hotel California’ to ‘Take It Easy\,’ we bring the Eagles’ greatest hits to life on stage. \nWinslow’s multi-lead vocalists authentically capture the soaring 5-part harmonies\, precise instrumentation\, and stage showmanship — performing the full Eagles catalog of greatest hits\, deep cuts\, and the solo work of Don Henley and Joe Walsh. \nCheck out Winslow: An Evening of The Eagles here!\nWebsite | Instagram | Facebook\n————————————————–\n*Ticket Alert* \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers. Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets. Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/winslow-an-evening-of-the-eagles/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2025/04/Winslow-2547RETcolor.jpg
